        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Study Notes Page — SEVENTEEN Hairstyles</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f2f2f0;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f7f6f2;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- decorative right-hand index tabs ---------- */\n  .tabs {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 720px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .tab {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #6b6b6b;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- header boxes ---------- */\n  .header-box {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 60px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #7a7a7a;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    width: 90px;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .header-box.chapter { top: 10px; }\n  .header-box.date { top: 30px; }\n\n  /* ---------- placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #e3e3e0;\n    border: 1px dashed #a9a9a9;\n    color: #555;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .ph-sticker {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6px;\n    left: 8px;\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n  .ph-photo1 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 52px;\n    left: 8px;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 285px;\n  }\n  .ph-photo2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 350px;\n    left: 8px;\n    width: 145px;\n    height: 365px;\n  }\n  .ph-photo3 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 520px;\n    left: 400px;\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 195px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- text columns ---------- */\n  .col-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 58px;\n    left: 222px;\n    width: 268px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-align: justify;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n  }\n  .col-bottom {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 522px;\n    left: 160px;\n    width: 232px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: justify;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n  }\n  p { margin: 0 0 4px 0; }\n  .cn { font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif; }\n\n  .hl-yellow { background: #f7e463; }\n  .hl-green  { background: #a8e6a0; }\n  .underline { border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }\n\n  .gloss {\n    display: block;\n    color: #d94a6a;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- watermarks ---------- */\n  .wm {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: rgba(120,120,120,0.28);\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header-box chapter\">Chapter</div>\n  <div class=\"header-box date\">Date</div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-sticker\">[Illustration: cartoon avatar, top-left]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-photo1\">[Photo: person with permed hair, upper-left]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-photo2\">[Photo: person in blue jacket holding microphone, lower-left]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-photo3\">[Photo: person in denim, lower-right]</figure>\n\n  <div class=\"col-right\">\n    <p>hair. The SEVENTEEN member permed his bangs as well to blend them in seamlessly with the rest of his hair. It gave them a <span class=\"hl-yellow underline\">fluffed-up</span> look that nicely framed his face\n    <span class=\"gloss\">(adj.) 蓬松的，蓬松状的</span>\n    and added tons of texture.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"cn\">第二，他把头发打理成了<span class=\"hl-yellow\">波浪的</span>刘海短发。在K-pop偶像中，波浪短发是一种流行的发型，许多人会将短发打理成波浪状，增加发型的质感和蓬松感。尹净汉选择了一款可爱的波浪短发，因为他有着长发，所以这个发型显得更有质感且蓬松。这位SEVENTEEN成员还将刘海打理成波浪状，使其与其他头发无缝融合。这使得刘海显得<span class=\"hl-green\">蓬松</span>，优美地勾勒出他的脸部线条并增添了丰富的质感。</p>\n\n    <p>Third, he had straight hair with braided front sections. When one has long hair, experimenting with braids is a must. Jeonghan incorporated a beautiful braid into the front sections of his hair, almost making it seem like the braid replaced a headband to hold the rest of his hair in place. He left his hair straight and smooth throughout, incorporating texture with the fun use of braids. He also left out his bangs to allow them to frame his face and highlight his gorgeous features.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col-bottom cn\">\n    <p>第三，他曾留过直发，前面的部分编成了辫子。拥有长发时，尝试编发是必不可少的。尹净汉在头发的前部分编了一条漂亮的辫子，几乎让人感觉这条辫子取代了发箍，将其余的头发固定在一起。他保持又直又光滑的头发，通过有趣的编发方式增加了质感。他还把刘海留了出来，使其能够装饰他的脸庞，突出他迷人的特点。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tabs\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">04</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">05</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">06</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">07</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">08</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">09</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">10</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">11</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">12</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">13</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">14</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">15</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:14px; left:66px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:12px; left:250px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:196px; left:14px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:352px; left:120px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:508px; left:206px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:604px; left:26px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:672px; left:60px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n  <div class=\"wm\" style=\"top:664px; left:300px;\">Sophie欣欣欣</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
